#: manual/api/runner.md:487
msgid "`OutputSink` folds the outputs of a batch so that the compiler cannot discard the work."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/runner.md:500
msgid "`fold` runs inside the timed region after every operation; `finish` runs after the clock stops and its value is passed to `@bench.Bench::keep`. `keep_last` keeps the last output. Use `OutputSink::new` with a cheap checksum when the output must be consumed:"
