msgid "The JSONL record (`record.to_jsonl()`) holds every event, and its summary the protocol, the seed and the environment. `document_from_jsonl` pairs the confirmatory blocks again, at both scales, and decides with the protocol's 1 % threshold; the HTML shows these decisions in a \"Comparisons\" table above the plots. Save the record next to the HTML."
