msgid "mare_mark is pre-1.0. The versioned contracts are the protocol identity `mmkp_2` (the former `mmkp_1` is deprecated and no longer produced), the JSONL artifacts `mmka_1`, the Plot IR schema `mmks_2` (the former `mmks_1` is deprecated) and the GEMM tuning configuration `mmkts_1`; readers reject other versions. Timing thresholds, candidate enumeration, HTML styling and private layouts are not compatibility promises. Each design page ends with the package's boundaries."
